#  HR Attrition Analytics Dashboard

*LIFE DASHBOARD LINK:* https://datastudio.google.com/reporting/99ba624d-8f2a-4f35-9af2-326f3dc285b2/page/9g10F/edit

## Overview

This folder contains the dashboard deliverables for the HR Attrition Analysis project.

The dashboard presents employee attrition patterns through visualisations designed to help stakeholders understand 
workforce trends.

## Tool
Looker Studio

## Dashboard Objectives

The dashboard helps users explore:

Overall employee attrition.
Attrition rates across departments.
Attrition patterns by employee tenure.
Relationships between overtime and attrition.
Relevant workforce characteristics.

## Key Findings

The analysis identified:

An attrition rate of 20.63% in the Sales department.
Relatively high attrition among employees with 0–2 years of tenure.
An association between overtime and employee attrition.

These findings describe patterns in the analysed dataset. They do not establish that any single factor causes employees 
to leave.

## Files

This folder may contain:

Dashboard screenshots.
Dashboard documentation.
A link to the interactive Looker Studio report.
Business Value

The dashboard helps HR stakeholders identify employee groups that may warrant further investigation and supports 
data-informed retention planning.
